    },
    {
      "text": "THIS IS NOT AI SLOP ❌\n\nReal software. Real people. Faster flights.\n\nSMART reroutes around storms and untangles air traffic in real time — so",
      "date": "2026-10-07",
      "date_quote": "2026-10-07T14:25:18.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Sean P. Duffy. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
      "url": "https://x.com/SecDuffy/status/2107839688954536303",
