      "sid": "s4",
      "added": "2026-11-10"
    },
    {
      "text": "launching SMART — a new artificial intelligence tool that brings info from 200 data streams to ONE PLATFORM to predict weather and other interruptions… allowing",
      "date": "2026-09-22",
      "date_quote": "2026-09-22T19:44:48.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Sean P. Duffy. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
